# The first two lessons on a DPR-3 phone: the focused cube each step names, released (or refused) with Enter.
# viewport 390x844@3
frames 90
touch =All modes
frames 20
touch Learn
frames 20
touch Release
frames 60
repeat 3000 until Board cleared
key Enter 1
frames 8
end
frames 120
save l-results
expect Board cleared
touch =Next lesson
frames 60
repeat 3000 until Board cleared
key Enter 1
frames 8
end
frames 120
expect Board cleared
